    "title": "HD Video Downloader Quick Save",
    "description": "Video Downloader: Quick Save, the Ultimate Video Downloader!\r\n\r\nExperience seamless video downloading with our Video Downloader app, effortlessly download videos from different social media platforms, making it easier to save your favourite videos and enjoy them offline. Video Downloader: Quick Save is a simple and easy-to-use video downloading app that lets you download any video by its link. Just copy and paste the video link here in the app and get your favourite videos downloaded. This app is your perfect match; with fast downloads and quick save, you are ready to watch videos anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nFast video downloader to download and save videos, quick and safe.\r\nDownload video by link \r\nDownload manager\r\nDownload videos from different sites.\r\nSimultaneous downloading\r\nBuilt-in browser\r\nPlay videos offline with a built-in video player \r\nBackground downloading\r\nSave to gallery\r\nOption to choose video quality\r\nCheck downloads history\r\nCheck download progress\r\nShare downloaded videos with your friends and family\r\nAdd to \u201cFavourites\u201d\r\n\r\nDownload Video by link\r\nWith the Video Downloader app, you can download any video from the link. You just need to copy the video link from the site from which you want to download the video and then paste that link here in the app to download that video.\r\n\r\nDownload Manager\r\nThe fast download manager makes the downloading process easy and simple by allowing you to share, delete, cancel, download multiple videos simultaneously, and continue video download in the background. \r\n\r\nMultiple Downloading\r\nThis Video downloader player supports simultaneous downloading. You can download multiple videos at the same time which means that you will not have to wait for one video to finish downloading before starting download for the next one.\r\n\r\nDownload videos from different sites\r\nWith this video downloader and player, you can download and save social media videos from different social media platforms.  \r\n \r\nBuilt-in Browser \r\nWith the built-in browser, you can directly go to the site, search for a video, copy its link, and paste into the app to get it downloaded. \r\n\r\nVideo Player\r\nWith the built-in video player, you can play videos offline with full control for playback settings. You can switch between normal to full-screen display, adjust the volume level, and set the desired video resolution.\r\n\r\nBackground Downloading\r\nYou can start a video download and switch back to using the app. In this way, you can use the app without any interruptions while the downloading process continues in the background.\r\n\r\nDownload History\r\nYou can find the saved videos in the \u201cDownloads\u201d. In addition to this, you have the option to share or delete a video from here",
